    "SATA/AHCI 512-byte sectors and M6 installed-volume bounds; one local profile without authentication/ACLs",
    "Named x86-64 BIOS/UEFI virtual profiles only; Secure Boot disabled; no universal or physical qualification",
    "Desktop work runs on the BSP; APs halt after original runtime qualification; no Windows or DOS application runtime",
    "GPT 128x128 canonical tables and primary MBR partitions; FAT32/Engine quick formats; no resize/move or filesystem conversion",
    "Installation still replaces the whole selected SATA disk after explicit erase consent; no dual-boot installation into a selected partition",
    "Finish opens the real persistent desktop immediately from the installation session; independent disk boot is qualified separately",
    "Files browses the installed native volume; additional partitions are not automatically mounted; system folders are read-only in Files",
    "Inter OFL coverage masks at native physical font sizes, 100/150/200 percent UI scales; no runtime font interpreter",
    "4K refers to qualified framebuffer modes, not every physical monitor or GPU",
    "Basic static HTML/text HTTPS browser; no JavaScript/CSS layout/forms/cookies",
    "PCM WAV/HDA only; BMP only; ZIP Stored/Deflate extraction only",
    "Calendar stores local day notes; reminders/synchronization remain future",
    "Fresh installs qualified; cross-version package-cache migration not qualified"
